Package: cellinfo.utils.pkg
Type: Package
Title: Utilities for Cellinfo Objects Used in Single-Cell Workflows
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Luis", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "luis@example.com")
    )
Description: Provides helpers to create, refresh, annotate, subset, seriate,
    and visualise cellinfo list objects used alongside Seurat single-cell
    analyses. Functions were extracted from the project mlutils setup scripts
    and packaged with roxygen2 documentation. Several workflows also expect
    companion helpers from the parent mlutils codebase (for example
    join_meta_exp2(), AddModuleScore3(), seriatecells(), and tpdf()).
